    "description": "The Leno King Upholstered Cloud Bed combines a wide, low-profile silhouette with fully upholstered, frameless foam construction for a softer take on the modern bed. Rounded corners and generously cushioned edges help reduce exposed hard surfaces, while the low, legless profile creates a cleaner look and minimizes protruding points around the frame. Its inset mattress design, non-slip base, and concealed fastening system help keep the mattress more securely in place for a steadier sleeping surface. Wrapped from headboard to footboard in soft white Bouclé, Leno creates a cohesive, fully upholstered look with a more cushioned feel throughout. Medium-firm foam adds comfortable support along the frame for resting, reclining, or relaxing in bed, while the padded surround offers a softer alternative to more rigid, hard-edged bed frames. Designed for a standard King mattress measuring 76\"W × 80\"L, its broad proportions bring together the enveloping feel of a cloud bed with a clean, structured silhouette. The Bouclé upholstery is tested to 30,000 Martindale rubs and carries a 4.5/5 stain-resistance rating for added everyday practicality. The foam used in the bed frame is CertiPUR-US® certified and SGS-tested with no detectable PFAS. Concealed zip connections help hold the upholstered sections securely together while keeping assembly straightforward, with no complicated hardware or tools required.",
