    "description": "The Avera Queen Upholstered Cloud Bed pairs a low-profile silhouette with a fully upholstered, frameless foam construction for a softer, more relaxed take on the modern bed. Its low proportions help the bed feel visually lighter and less bulky in the bedroom. Wrapped in soft white Bouclé with medium-firm cushioning, Avera offers comfortable support for leaning and lounging. Fully upholstered edges soften exposed surfaces and help reduce everyday bumps, making it well suited to homes with children. Sized for a standard Queen mattress (60\"W × 80\"L), its cloud-like comfort is balanced by a clean, structured silhouette. The Bouclé upholstery is tested to 30,000 Martindale rubs and carries a 4.5/5 stain-resistance rating for added everyday practicality. The foam used in the bed frame is CertiPUR-US® certified and SGS-tested with no detectable PFAS. A streamlined construction also helps keep setup simple, making Avera an easy fit for bedrooms that favor soft comfort, low visual weight, and a modern upholstered look.",
