    "description": "The Elora Queen Upholstered Cloud Bed features a low-profile silhouette, a softly curved asymmetrical headboard, and a fully upholstered, frameless foam construction. Rounded lines, fully padded edges, and a legless base help minimize exposed hard corners and protruding elements, creating a smooth, sculptural look while reducing the chance of bumping into rigid edges as you move around the bedroom. Soft bouclé upholstery adds rich texture and a warm, inviting feel to the minimalist design. Designed to fit a standard Queen mattress measuring 60 inches wide by 80 inches long, Elora features a recessed mattress platform, an anti-slip base fabric, and concealed connection points designed to enhance everyday stability. The bed is padded with medium-firm foam throughout, providing soft, comfortable support for lounging, reading, or relaxing. The bouclé upholstery has been tested to 30,000 Martindale rubs and carries a 4.5/5 stain-resistance rating, balancing a soft hand feel with practical everyday durability. The foam used in the bed is CertiPUR-US® Certified and SGS tested, with no detectable PFAS. Its streamlined construction also helps simplify assembly while maintaining Elora’s seamless, fully upholstered appearance.",
